# Literature corpora. Third-party published papers, read against the project but
# never ported from — their canonical home is arXiv, and PDF/ alone is 906 MB
# against a 6 MB tracked repository. Documentation/LITERATURE_CORPUS.md records
# what was checked and the SHA-256 of each file checked, which is what makes a
# finding re-verifiable; the bytes themselves are not evidence of anything.
